by of reading shoujo manga. Arika lost her mother when she was young, but still remember her mother's teaching of \"love everyone\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When transformed, Arika's weapon is a magical staff and she mainly fight through long-range magic"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39974"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にでも明るく優しい、それでいてお人好しな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性格から、みんなから好かれているが、いつか変なことに巻き込まれないか周りは心配している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りんとは幼なじみで、何でも話せる仲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家では父親と二人暮らし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころ母親から教わった「みんなを好きになりなさい」という言葉を大切にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は少女漫画干渉、夢見る乙女で少々夢見がち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hに関して、耳年増な部分があるが、そのほとんどは少女漫画で得た知識。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦いではデバイスを杖のような武器へと変化させ、愛情を魔力に変え魔法主体で戦う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『みんなが幸せになれるなら、わたしなんだってやります！！』"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7769","sourceWorkId":"22394","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7769","sourceWorkId":"22394","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"48 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7769","sourceWorkId":"22394","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b283966cd028cf7b3ced21d1d6e938b4efd8a69c6358724082f408ac33172641.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0507b439e0335201d4463f5a2a37fc564201baa9f3c3f633782c46cd882050a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤 さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:66122","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c39976","characterName":"鈴倉 りん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"e